                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__qstr-1__sec-23A">
                  <num>23A</num>
                  <heading>Goods that are prohibited from export by sea</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>On and after <date date="2028-05-01">1 May 2028</date>, the export from Australian territory of sheep (including the young of that animal) by sea is prohibited.</p>
